'''Salvage Old Attributes''' is an [[NPC]] located in {{Zone|Tangleburg}}. They allow the player to salvage [[Attributes]] from [[Armor]], [[Equipment]], and [[Weapons]].

== Salvaging Attributes ==
Interacting with '''Salvage Old Attributes''' opens up a menu to remove [[Attributes]] from items and turn them into [[Attribute Shards]]. If the [[Attributes]] salvaged are considered a god roll, then an {{Item|Ananke Feather}} is rewarded as well.

